  "releaseNotes": "TinyEvents.Worker 0.1.0-alpha.3\n\n      Added\n      - Startup validation for the generated dispatcher graph and provider-specific dependencies.\n      - Structured worker failure, recovery, retry-exhaustion, and lease-loss logging.\n      - Configurable, validated worker polling, batching, claim, and retry options.\n\n      Hardened\n      - Iteration failures no longer terminate the hosted worker.\n      - Cancellation remains distinct from operational failure and retry behavior.\n\n      Compatibility\n      - Early alpha / active development.\n      - APIs may change before 1.0.\n      - Requires a matching alpha.3 TinyEvents core and exactly one database provider.",
